clr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=dfaf8a2d14ab5df6405a6187482efbb4, https://si.imgix.net/66ea44d7/uploads/origins/a6a2274d-1550-443f-94e7-a019f9bbf41e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=121a78f13f8964ca055a9b39ec8e95fa 2x, https://si.imgix.net/66ea44d7/uploads/origins/a6a2274d-1550-443f-94e7-a019f9bbf41e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=9e7f03c2a427adcf72d9537c0f4e51c2 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ro16t0day8/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/28bcc868/uploads/origins/2c43b5ed-ff6d-476d-b08d-5b1a1022bf54?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0f33bf37095bdd4ad4bbcf4ddc2b1d97", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/28bcc868/uploads/origins/2c43b5ed-ff6d-476d-b08d-5b1a1022bf54?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0f33bf37095bdd4ad4bbcf4ddc2b1d97, https://si.imgix.net/28bcc868/uploads/origins/2c43b5ed-ff6d-476d-b08d-5b1a1022bf54?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d8cdbcd1ae6d4e3baffc82b126ffe653 2x, https://si.imgix.net/28bcc868/uploads/origins/2c43b5ed-ff6d-476d-b08d-5b1a1022bf54?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c550f9ecdd6f895367418122d159366d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "先生、こんにちは。先生の絵が大好きで、またイラストをお願いしたいのですが、宜しいでしょうか？キャラクター参考：https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/17pLD4LehTPwPf0Hy3NK3C7ZZDUnuQj6d?usp=sharing\n私のキャラクターは とおか様 のデザインです。\n幼なじみで、お互い好きだけど、まだ言い合っていない。男の子は優しくて人懐っこい。女の子は明るくて元気な子です。男の子が女の子を初めてデートに誘うようなイメージで描いてください。男の子は少し緊張していて、二人とも少し恥ずかしがっています。男の子は花を持っていてもいいですが、おまかせします。\n衣装は、参考フォルダに添付してあるものをお使いください。衣装はsaki19755さんのデザインです。\nもしよろしければ、個人使用（販売・配布不可）用にプリントしたいと思います。\n問題があれば遠慮なくお断りください。\nご検討のほど、よろしくお願いいたします", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ro16t0day8/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b6900458/uploads/origins/736d2a8e-0342-4001-a21e-79dcacb2b185?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=95ed6fbf450a1f05accdda8773d1d15e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b6900458/uploads/origins/736d2a8e-0342-4001-a21e-79dcacb2b185?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=95ed6fbf450a1f05accdda8773d1d15e, https://si.imgix.net/b6900458/uploads/origins/736d2a8e-0342-4001-a21e-79dcacb2b185?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bd9b43e46612d74ba82a232907b0c7f0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b6900458/uploads/origins/736d2a8e-0342-4001-a21e-79dcacb2b185?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2871b5cd97e683104c3edba44ac4688f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello sensei! I’m back to request Chiyo and Miyu! https://sta.sh/2286vi45dz3t?edit=1  \n\nIf it’s not too much trouble, I would like to request a comic/manga this time. It can be a sketch, I do not mind!  If this is not appropriate, please feel free to cancel! I can send a different request. \n\nMy friend came up with this idea and I thought it would be cute! It’s a bit romantic… I hope that is okay. It can be a continuation of the last drawing you did!\n\nThe boy and girl are dancing together. Even though the girl was surprised at first, they are now both smiling. The boy looks at the girl and pulls her into a gentle hug. The boy kisses her cheek which surprises her. The girl blushes and is a bit frustrated because the boy is always making her shy. Chiyo musters her courage to kiss him on the lips! It’s clumsy but it surprises the boy (Miyu). Still, he smiles into the kiss. The moon is shining bright.\n\nThank you for your time.\n\nhttps://sta.sh/2286vi45dz3t?edit=1", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ro16t0day8/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c2fbf54d/uploads/origins/7815d936-4c71-4def-8f1f-1d86f4c352ed?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8b9c6c3fb086ae4f6657dabc621f900d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c2fbf54d/uploads/origins/7815d936-4c71-4def-8f1f-1d86f4c352ed?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8b9c6c3fb086ae4f6657dabc621f900d, https://si.imgix.net/c2fbf54d/uploads/origins/7815d936-4c71-4def-8f1f-1d86f4c352ed?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3115b497cdf6dd5439a25749b566f9dd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c2fbf54d/uploads/origins/7815d936-4c71-4def-8f1f-1d86f4c352ed?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=966e21b0a97585aa367a3a705a25dc0b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello sensei! I’m back to send another request since I love the previous one so much! I hope sensei does not mind 💙💙 \n\nMay I request these two characters? (https://sta.sh/22q5nxyly0w?edit=1)\n\n🐹 Yi Ke is always very happy and cheerful! She's very air headed and gullible. She's quite clumsy at times, but tries her best to help those in need. She is very expressive. \n\n🐰Xun is apathetic and always looks cold or disinterested. His gentleness is rare and only shows in his actions. His face is usually blank. Even then, his expression is not expressive. He is surprisingly the more affectionate one and quietly sticks to her.\n\nSensei can draw them in any of the modern outfits shown (please do not draw their Saint/demon King paro) please note that both have wedding rings! I leave the interaction to sensei ❤️\n\nIf this request is not appropriate, feel free to cancel! Thank you!\n\nhttps://sta.sh/22q5nxyly0w?edit=1", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ro16t0day8/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/247ba775/uploads/origins/21e0d1ae-b3f0-4d82-831e-d31614a3bad9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9e04384ae39fc4b5ae2d33cda00987eb", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/247ba775/uploads/origins/21e0d1ae-b3f0-4d82-831e-d31614a3bad9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9e04384ae39fc4b5ae2d33cda00987eb, https://si.imgix.net/247ba775/uploads/origins/21e0d1ae-b3f0-4d82-831e-d31614a3bad9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f0faf794c591ccc06ea04fbc7a7e1d9f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/247ba775/uploads/origins/21e0d1ae-b3f0-4d82-831e-d31614a3bad9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cb061cc4bc6c690a8de8715eff35f63c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "先生、こんにちは。私はあなたの繊細な作品が本当に好きです，私のキャラクターのイラストをデザインしてもらえませんか？(2人のキャラクターは、それぞれDen-99とChangQuanによってデザインされました。)ウェブサイトへのリンクはこちら https://imgur.com/a/QdHT2Kt とhttps://imgur.com/a/Ohmq7GR\nどちらのキャラクターもドラゴンで、仲良しです。二人は子供の頃からの知り合いなので、お互いのことをよく知っています。よろしければ、笑顔で人生を楽しんでいる二人を描いてください。この作品の雰囲気がとても好きです。 https://twitter.com/ro16t0day8/status/1508838728852451330ご自身のアイデアで作成していただければ幸いです。どうぞよろしくお願いいたします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ro16t0day8/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2517da65/uploads/origins/62f2fc25-3a97-490b-adec-592fa678cb3b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e747ce63413de73a12c89581993d5b1e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2517da65/uploads/origins/62f2fc25-3a97-490b-adec-592fa678cb3b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e747ce63413de73a12c89581993d5b1e, https://si.imgix.net/2517da65/uploads/origins/62f2fc25-3a97-490b-adec-592fa678cb3b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=14096a5605dd2a95494c56b59585b233 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2517da65/uploads/origins/62f2fc25-3a97-490b-adec-592fa678cb3b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a0b561ca76da47107433c85656f9ba70 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello sensei! Your art style is so charming and I love the way you draw smiles! It’s so cute! May I request a drawing of these two characters? https://sta.sh/2286vi45dz3t?edit=1\n\nThe girl is reserved and quiet while the boy is actually an alien prince! He came to Earth to find a bride and he chose Chiyo. Is it possible to request a scene of the boy playfully pulling the girl along? Or a scene of the boy leading her in a dance? Chiyo is caught off guard. If sensei has other ideas, you are welcome to draw freely! \n\nIf this request is not appropriate, feel free to cancel! Feel free to raise the price as well.\n\nhttps://sta.sh/2286vi45dz3t?edit=1", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}